# Destructive one-shot scripts that have already been executed against production.
# The safe, guarded copy lives in supabase/_archive/. If an editor ever recreates
# the original at the path below (e.g. from a stale buffer), this rule ensures it
# can never be re-tracked or committed by accident. Never delete this line.
/supabase/clear_feed_pre_launch.sql
